      "id": 13811,
      "hub_id": null,
      "version": "2.1.0",
      "description": "<p>More voices from gfl1 (the_real_nickisnothing’s idea) for the following dolls: Springfield, Suomi, Tololo, Vector, Voymastina, Yoohee, Belka, Basti and Alva</p>\n<p>PMC bots can now use the voices! If you however dont like this change, you can modify the GFLVoices.json in the the mod folder “SPT\\user\\mods\\GFLVoices\\db\\CustomVoices\\GFLVoices.json” and change the usec and bear values to zero.</p>\n<p>Once again, if you find any issues, say it in the comments. The other dolls will receive new voices soon. Peace</p>\n",
      "link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/2738/gflvoices/2.1.0",
